  "description": "<p><strong>IT’S A RESHADE. PUT IT IN THE GAME’S MAIN DIRECTORY. DON’T PUT IT IN A SUBFOLDER. IF YOU PUT IT IN A SUBFOLDER YOU WILL NOT GET SUPPORT.</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ULO41C5.png\" alt=\"ULO41C5.png\" /></p>\n<p>There’s nothing really special here. It’s a reshade preset that focuses purely on cinematics and looking pretty. Press Home to open the ReShade menu, press End to toggle the ReShade preset on/off.</p>\n<p>Mods that I strongly recommend using with this preset:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2683-hollywoodfx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hollywood FX</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/813-amands-s-graphics\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amands’s Graphics</a></p>\n<p>My PostFX settings:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VGJj5UB.png\" alt=\"VGJj5UB.png\" /></p>\n<p>and some screenshots</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zHekBPQ.png\" alt=\"zHekBPQ.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NbBvH8r.png\" alt=\"NbBvH8r.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3XPDuPK.png\" alt=\"3XPDuPK.png\" /></p>\n",
